                    <span class="badge bg-info text-dark mb-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">MEGA DISCOUNTS</span>
                    <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-white">Special Festive Offers</h1>
                    <p class="lead text-light">Grab massive discounts on smartwatches, audio devices, and trendy tech accessories.</p>
                    <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Offers" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold text-dark px-4 mt-2 shadow">
                        Check Offers <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
                    </a>
